{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"991","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"F. Concise and clear"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Vasya is a regular participant at programming contests and is already experienced in finding important sentences in long statements. Of course, numbers constraints are important — factorization of a number less than "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1000000"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" is easier than of a number less than "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1000000000"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". However, sometimes it's hard to understand the number at the first glance. Could it be shortened? For example, instead of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1000000"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" you could write $$$10^{6}$$$, instead of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1000000000"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"  —$$$10^{9}$$$, instead of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1000000007"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" — $$$10^{9}+7$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Vasya decided that, to be concise, the notation should follow several rules: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" the notation should only consist of numbers, operations of addition (\""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"+"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"), multiplication (\""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"*"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\") and exponentiation (\""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"^"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"), in particular, the use of braces is forbidden; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" the use of several exponentiation operations in a row is forbidden, for example, writing \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"2^3^4"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" is unacceptable; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" the value of the resulting expression equals to the initial number; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" the notation should consist of the minimal amount of symbols. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Given $$$n$$$, find the equivalent concise notation for it."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The only line contains a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\leq n \\leq 10\\,000\\,000\\,000$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output a concise notation of the number $$$n$$$. If there are several concise notations, output any of them."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2018\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2018\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1000000007\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"10^9+7\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"10000000000\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"100^5\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2000000000\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2*10^9\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The third sample allows the answer "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"10^10"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" also of the length $$$5$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"F","problemCode":"991F","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/991/problem/F"}